[{"id":"CN-DIAG-002","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["curl","复现"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":10,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>curl -v、-D -、-L 分别提供什么证据？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>-v 输出客户端连接/TLS/请求响应方向，-D - 输出响应头，-L 跟随重定向并产生后续请求链。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>curl 默认不是浏览器，通常不执行同源策略。使用 -L 后必须记录每一跳方法、状态、Location 和凭据处理，避免只看最终响应。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>可以把参数和证据对应起来：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">curl -v -D - -L https://example.test/start\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>-v 观察连接与 TLS 方向，-D - 保留每跳响应头，-L 才会继续请求 Location；复现后要记录每一跳的方法、状态、凭据和目标。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-DIAG-FAQ-005","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTPS","抓包","TLS"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/"}],"articleIndex":10,"articleCount":10,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>抓包能直接看到 HTTPS 的 URL 和 JSON 吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>通常不能直接看到 TLS 保护的应用内容；可以看到 IP、端口、握手元数据和时序。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>HTTPS 把 HTTP 的路径、查询参数、请求头和 JSON 等应用内容放进 TLS 加密层。普通客户端侧抓包通常只能看到 IP、端口、握手元数据、包大小和时序；SNI 等元数据是否可见还取决于协议和配置。只有在自有测试环境的合法 TLS 终止点或调试解密材料处，才能读取完整 URL 和 JSON。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>抓包位置\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>通常能看到\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>不能直接看到\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>客户端到 HTTPS 服务\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>IP/端口、部分握手信息、时序和大小\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>HTTP 路径、Cookie、JSON\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>反向代理 TLS 终止点\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>解密后的 HTTP 请求/响应\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>终止点之后再次加密链路的内容\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>自有测试设备的调试代理\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>经过授权的测试流量内容\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>生产私钥或未授权用户数据\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>因此要先说明抓包点和 TLS 终止点；不要为了“看见内容”导出生产私钥或扩大解密范围。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-L2-005","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["ARP","邻居发现"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/"}],"articleIndex":11,"articleCount":18,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>ARP request 为什么通常使用广播，而 ARP reply 通常可以使用单播？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>请求方还不知道目标 MAC，只能在广播域询问；目标收到请求后知道请求方 MAC，可以直接单播回复。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>ARP 缓存会减少重复广播。观察 ARP 时应同时看 Ethernet 目的 MAC 和 ARP payload 中的协议地址。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>把地址解析放回一跳范围就容易判断：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>目标\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>当前帧目的 MAC\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>为什么\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>同网段主机\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>目标主机 MAC\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>目标就在本链路\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>远端网络\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>默认网关 MAC\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>网关是这一跳的下一站\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>可用下面的最小证据核对缓存与报文，而不是只猜地址：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">ip neigh\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">tcpdump -ni eth0 \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;arp or icmp6&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a12-posix-bash","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["POSIX","Bash"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十二)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十二)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/9efa11cb/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十二)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十二)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/9efa11cb/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Bash POSIX mode 的价值是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它帮助识别 Bash 扩展与 POSIX 语义的边界，便于写可移植脚本。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>POSIX mode 更像一面“边界探针”，不会替脚本翻译成 POSIX：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">bash --posix -c \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;printf &quot;%s\\n&quot; &quot;$-&quot;; command -v printf&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>数组、进程替换、\u003ccode>[[ ... ]]\u003c/code> 等 Bash 扩展仍需要主动移除或替换；同一段代码要在目标 \u003ccode>sh\u003c/code>、locale 和工具版本上实测。开启模式后能暴露部分差异，但通过一次启动检查不等于跨发行版可移植。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-05-relational-division-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["关系除法","NOT EXISTS","全集"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询","articlePath":"posts/55ce38b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询","articlePath":"posts/55ce38b/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>查询购买过商品 101、102、103 全部商品的用户，且只计算 paid 订单，SQL 怎么写？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">11\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> u.id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> users \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> u\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">EXISTS\u003c/span> (\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> products \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> required\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> required.id \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">IN\u003c/span> (\u003cspan class=\"number\">101\u003c/span>,\u003cspan class=\"number\">102\u003c/span>,\u003cspan class=\"number\">103\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">EXISTS\u003c/span> (\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">      \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> orders o \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">JOIN\u003c/span> order_items oi \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ON\u003c/span> oi.order_id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> o.id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">      \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> o.user_id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> u.id \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> o.status \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;paid&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> oi.product_id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> required.id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    )\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> u.id;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>双重 \u003ccode>NOT EXISTS\u003c/code> 对应“没有一个必需商品缺失”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">required 商品集合\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  └─ 对每个商品检查 paid 订单中是否存在\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">       ├─ 缺失任意一个 → 排除用户\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">       └─ 全部存在 → 保留用户\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>先对需求集合去重，重复购买不能把同一商品算两次；再固定 \u003ccode>o.status = &#39;paid&#39;\u003c/code>，否则待支付订单也会满足条件。需求集合为空时是“所有用户都满足”还是“返回空集”，需要由业务先定义，SQL 不能替你猜。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-04-conditional-aggregation-p2","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["条件聚合","CASE","HAVING"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(四)查询基础与聚合.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(四)查询基础与聚合","articlePath":"posts/80283a7e/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(四)查询基础与聚合.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(四)查询基础与聚合","articlePath":"posts/80283a7e/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>一次扫描统计每个用户的订单总数、paid 数量和 cancelled 数量，并只保留总数至少为 3 的用户，SQL 怎么写？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> user_id, \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">COUNT\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"operator\">*\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> total_orders,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">       \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">SUM\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CASE\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHEN\u003c/span> status \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;paid&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">THEN\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ELSE\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">0\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">END\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> paid_orders,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">       \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">SUM\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CASE\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHEN\u003c/span> status \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;cancelled&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">THEN\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ELSE\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">0\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">END\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> cancelled_orders\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> orders\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">GROUP\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> user_id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">HAVING\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">COUNT\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"operator\">*\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&gt;=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">3\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> user_id;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>WHERE\u003c/code> 决定进入分组的行，\u003ccode>SUM(CASE ...)\u003c/code> 决定每个状态的分子，\u003ccode>HAVING\u003c/code> 最后过滤分组：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">orders\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  ├─ WHERE（本题不先删状态）\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  ├─ GROUP BY user_id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  ├─ COUNT(*) / SUM(CASE ...) 计算各列\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  └─ HAVING COUNT(*) &gt;= 3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>如果把 \u003ccode>status = &#39;paid&#39;\u003c/code> 放进 \u003ccode>WHERE\u003c/code>，总数分母就只剩 paid 行。示例 seed 的用户 1 输出为 \u003ccode>3 / 2 / 1\u003c/code>；允许 \u003ccode>NULL\u003c/code> 时要在 \u003ccode>CASE\u003c/code> 中明确它的归类，并用 \u003ccode>ORDER BY user_id\u003c/code> 固定结果顺序。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-iteration-iterable-iterator","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","迭代器","iter","next"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器.md","articleTitle":"Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器","articlePath":"posts/be636c04/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器.md","articleTitle":"Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器","articlePath":"posts/be636c04/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>可迭代对象、迭代器和生成器分别是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>可迭代对象能被 \u003ccode>iter()\u003c/code> 取出迭代器；迭代器用 \u003ccode>next()\u003c/code> 逐项产出；生成器是实现迭代器协议的一种简洁方式。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>“能被 \u003ccode>for\u003c/code> 遍历”与“自己保存遍历进度”是两个层次：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">items = [\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;a&quot;\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;b&quot;\u003c/span>]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">first = \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">iter\u003c/span>(items)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">second = \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">iter\u003c/span>(items)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">next\u003c/span>(first), \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">next\u003c/span>(first))  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># a b\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">next\u003c/span>(second))              \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># a：另一条独立游标\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">stream = (value * \u003cspan class=\"number\">2\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">for\u003c/span> value \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">in\u003c/span> items)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">list\u003c/span>(stream))              \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># [&#x27;aa&#x27;, &#x27;bb&#x27;]\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">list\u003c/span>(stream))              \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># []：生成器已耗尽\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>列表是可重复迭代的可迭代对象；迭代器和生成器保存当前位置，通常只能向前消费一次。\u003ccode>for\u003c/code> 会在内部调用 \u003ccode>iter()\u003c/code>/\u003ccode>next()\u003c/code>，并把 \u003ccode>StopIteration\u003c/code> 转换为正常结束。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]